%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIs that what you call a decision?!\d%K%P
「这是哪门子的结论啊！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I'm sorry. Even I find it somewhat... well, you know.\nBut I really have no other answer to give you at the\nmoment!\d%K%P
「呀，抱歉，说实话，我自己都不知道怎么想的！\n但是就现在的情况来看没有除此之外的结论了…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOsamu, you are -such- a goddamn indecisive, wishy-washy\nlittle milksop. You're just pathetic for a man your age,\nyou know that?\d%K%P
「理君真是优柔寡断，又没有独立性，拖拖拉拉的，\n真不像这个年岁的男人啊～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI know! That's just the kind of man I am! So why on earth\ndid you think I was fit for someone like you?!\d%K%P
「是啊，我就是这种男人啊！\n所以说为什么夏夜小姐还觉得我好啊？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...So? What was that about your current position?\d%K%P
「…那，\n为什么没有闲心？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOh, so it's okay for you to change the subject?\d%K%P
「…明明你自己也想岔开话题的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dY'know, nitpicking little details like that is just\npathetic for a man your age, too...\d%K%P
「鸡蛋里面挑骨头，\n真不像这个年岁的男人…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI have no room for anyone but Mitoko in my mind right\nnow, okay?!\d%K%P
「现在我不会考虑美都子以外的事情！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...That's all.\d%K%P
「…就是这样」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...So she's in your crosshairs, is she?\d%K%P
「…早就在守备范围内了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm talking about her future!\d%K%P
「是她的将来！」%K%P
I think I'm finally getting the hang of these rapid-fire\nretorts.%K%P
果然在预计的反应中，因此我也立刻作出了回答。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm talking about her continuing her education. Mitoko\ndoesn't seem very excited about the idea because of what's\ngoing on with her family and all.\d%K%P
「目前是升学的事情，\n将来也会有美都子家庭的事情，\n所以对于那方面的事，我现在不怎么感兴趣」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWell... I'd imagine so. Not only does she have it\ntogether, she's the most headstrong person I'd ever met. I\nbet she doesn't want to inconvenience you financially.\d%K%P
「那个嘛…也是呢。\n那个女孩，不仅可靠而且非常倔强。\n她也不想增加理君金钱上的负担吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah, that's the problem. It looks like she finally\nstarted to rely on me a little, but whenever it comes to\nmoney...\d%K%P
「麻烦就在这里啊…\n好不容易才一点点让她能依靠我的，\n只是因为金钱的事情就困住了…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWell, you'll first have to find a job, at least.\d%K%P
「毕竟理君现在没就职呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dStill, unless she picks a school soon, she's going to get\nleft behind. I want her to attend summer cram school as\nwell.\d%K%P
「但是呢，志愿学校什么的不决定的话，\n就等于输在了起跑线上了吧。\n如果可能的话，我想让她去上夏季课程的补习班」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBut she already has pretty good grades, doesn't she?\d%K%P
「那个女孩，不这样做也能学好吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's because she was working hard even when the other\nkids were fooling around. Now that everyone's gonna be\nforced to take things seriously, I wonder if she can\nmaintain her ranking.\d%K%P
「以前其他的孩子们都在玩中努力学习，\n今后的时期大家都会更加努力了，\n那她还怎么能稳定成绩呢…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSo... you wouldn't say she's talented, then?\d%K%P
「才能没得到认可么？房东小姐的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI think she's good at committing things to memory, and\nshe's passionate about studying. ...The only problem is,\nwell... flexibility, I suppose.\d%K%P
「我觉得她的记忆力不错，而且有热情。\n…剩下就是灵感问题了」%K%P
From what I checked, she seemed to solve basic problems\nwith almost a hundred percent success rate, but when it\ncame to applied stuff and trick questions, the amount of\nher correct answers would be halved.%K%P
练习题和基本问题大体上都能完美解决。\n而应用题的正确率…只有一半左右。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dShe isn't planning to go to Teidai or Yatsubashi in the\nfuture, right? I think you should give her more space to\ndo what she wants.\d%K%P
「将来不是要以帝王啊八桥之类大学为目标的吧？\n现在从容一些去准备不也挺好的么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut it never hurts to have more possibilities. Her\ncurrent efforts will definitely pay off in the future.\d%K%P
「但是，选项多一些是再好不过的。\n现在努力，几年后一定会有用的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWell, it's not like everyone who graduates from\nYatsubashi ends up leading a lucrative life anyway. When\nwe lose our jobs, we're all the same.\d%K%P
「即使进入八桥，\n失去工作也是一瞬间吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAah?!\d%K%P
「啊啊！？」%K%P
In the end...%K%P
结果…%K%P
...while the situation got pretty heated in the middle, I\nmanaged to somehow cool it down by discussing the current\neducational grievances of the Terrace House Hinosaka.%K%P
我们酒会上原本相当危险的气氛，\n从中途开始就发展成了谈论Terrace House阳之坂教育问题了…%K%P
After Ms. Kaya sluggishly stumbled back to her room, I\nmade a dash for the toilet and pretty much claimed it for\nmyself until next morning.%K%P
夏夜小姐步履蹒跚地回到房间之后，我一刻也没有担待，\n大跨步地冲进了厕所，一直独占到早上。%K%P
